# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shared github-rep conventions for public static-site repositories.
# Keep this block identical across the site repos so that local noise, secrets
# and pre-edit backups are handled the same way everywhere.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local environment files — never publish secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log

# Timestamped pre-edit backups and local working copies.
# These must never be served as site assets.
*.pre-*
*.pre-lab-pass
*.backup
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak_*
*.secops-backup/

# Internal planning notes — not for a public repository
PROJECT.md
